<title>USA: Dravo Corp Q3 shr increases.</title>
<headline>Dravo Corp Q3 shr increases.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>(unaudited,  in 000's, except per share$data)</p>
<p>						     For the three months</p>
<p>							ended September 30,</p>
<p>							1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue					  40,752	   37,774</p>
<p> Net earnings				    3,633	    2,930</p>
<p> Earnings per share			     0.20	     0.15</p>
<p> Shares outstanding			   14,936	   14,889</p>
<p>							For the nine months</p>
<p>							ended September 30,</p>
<p>							1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenue					 118,325	  107,376</p>
<p> Net earnings				   10,190	    8,183</p>
<p> Earnings per share			     0.56	     0.42</p>
<p> Shares outstanding			   14,879	   14,896</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
